# Custom recipe for Mobile-Broadband-Provider-Info 20240407 (meson)
# The MMoN carrier/location database (serviceproviders.xml + apns-conf.xml)
# that plasma-nm's mobile-broadband account editor reads. Built BEFORE
# plasma-nm: its CMakeLists does
# pkg_get_variable(BROADBANDPROVIDER_DATABASE mobile-broadband-provider-info database)
# so the generated mobile-broadband-provider-info.pc (with the `database`
# variable pointing at serviceproviders.xml) must be merged into /System/Index.
#
# meson-based; the produced files go to share/mobile-broadband-provider-info/.
# The `tests` subdir only uses grep/xmllint (LibXML2 in-tree), not run at
# build. xsltproc + gettext already present. glib/gio not required.
compile_version=017-GIT
